       │                          MCP Manager                           │
       │                                                                │
       │  [LOCAL] ───  GLOBAL  ───  USER                                │
       │  Writes to: .mcp.json (this project only)                      │
       │                                                                │
       │                                                                │
       │  No MCPs configured                                            │
       │                                                                │
       │  To add MCPs, edit:                                            │
       │    /tmp/vc-<tmp>                  │
       │                                                                │
       │  Example:                                                      │
       │    [mcps.example]                                              │
       │    command = "npx"                                             │
       │    args = ["-y", "@example/mcp"]                               │
       │                                                                │
       │  Then press M again to see them here.                          │
       │  [S]=stdio  [H]=http  [E]=sse  ●=running  ○=external           │
       │  ✗=stopped                                                     │
       │                                                                │
       │  Tab scope │ ←→ column │ Type jump │ Space move │ Enter apply  │
       │  │ Esc cancel                                                  │
       │                                                                │
       ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯